## How to attribute

> Microalgae 3D Atlas — Giovanni Luca Russo, CC BY 4.0.
> https://github.com/giovannilucarusso-ui/Microalgae-3D-Atlas

For anything derived from the anatomical data, cite the atlas itself
(`CITATION.cff`) — the numbers carry their own primary sources, and a figure
reused without them loses the one thing that distinguishes it from an
illustration.

